# Comments: English, why not what

Source comments (`//`, block, JSDoc, TSDoc) are **English**. User-facing copy lives in the UI schema or i18n files, not in comments.

Comment the **why** the code cannot show (constraint, trade-off, non-obvious invariant). Do **not** add a docstring that restates the name, params, or return type.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — restates the signature
/** Returns the hotel id from the session. */
function getHotelId(session: Session): string {}

// ✅ GOOD — records a constraint the signature hides
/** Hotel id comes from the verified session, never from the request body. */
function getHotelId(session: Session): string {}
```

Exceptions: third-party license headers, legally required verbatim text.
